  "details": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=skdaKG0itbU\n\nSo I've seen a similar issue occur on live, but I've never seen it happen where IK ceases to work as well. So I'm going to assume that it's new to this build. But as seen in the video, several users experienced this on this world during the Community Meetup this past Sunday. When It happened my ping was around 75-80. Licifer MStar was also experiencing this with a ping of around 170. This world is currently private but I got permission to post the world id here as well just in case: wrld_5cb4db8b-f44c-47f2-b17b-55d353261559\n\nNot quite sure where to put a log on Canny, as it seems to be too powerful for pastebin, but I have one from the same session as the video if it's required.",
